        "text": "=Last week's company expenses, grouped by department and category. All amounts are in EUR.\ncount_id = number of receipts, sum_total_eur = amount spent, sum_approved_amount_eur = amount reimbursed.\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($input.all().map(i => i.json)) }}\n\nWrite a short summary for the finance team in 3–5 sentences:\n- total spent vs total reimbursed\n- which department and category spent the most\n- any rejected or reduced expenses (where reimbursed is less than spent)\n- anything unusual\n\nPlain text only. No greeting, no markdown, no bullet symbols. Use ONLY the numbers given, never invent figures.",
